just
====

Portions of this project (net.morphismmc.just.fmt) are ports of code
from the Rust standard library (rust-lang/rust, rustc 1.96.0):

- `core::num::imp::flt2dec` (incl. `decoder`, `estimator`) — Flt2dec.java
- `core::num::imp::flt2dec::strategy::grisu` — Grisu.java
- `core::num::imp::flt2dec::strategy::dragon` — Dragon.java
- `core::num::imp::diy_float` — Fp.java
- `core::num::imp::bignum` — Big.java
- `core::fmt::float` (Display/Debug glue) — RustFmt.java

